00:28:52.932 --> 00:28:54.902
you know, taking the plane...


00:28:56.135 --> 00:28:57.905
I dunno, flying and landing,
the cafes, pubs...


00:28:58.505 --> 00:29:00.207
the cigarettes...


00:29:00.806 --> 00:29:02.642
The wind,


00:29:03.642 --> 00:29:04.845
