00:29:05.945 --> 00:29:07.113
That is not real.


00:29:08.080 --> 00:29:09.816
That was our idea of love.


00:29:10.349 --> 00:29:13.120
We love the idea of love more than each other.


00:29:13.818 --> 00:29:15.521
We love the distance.


00:29:16.388 --> 00:29:19.259
But when there's no more distance...


00:29:19.791 --> 00:29:20.826
When...


00:29:21.492 --> 00:29:23.462
when there's no more oceans to cross


00:29:23.695 --> 00:29:25.899
and all there's left to cross
is a hallway...


00:29:28.099 --> 00:29:29.100
Anyway,


00:29:30.767 --> 00:29:31.935
...it's over.


00:29:35.340 --> 00:29:37.544
I received the letter two days after


00:29:39.176 --> 00:29:40.144
