00:29:45.983 --> 00:29:47.085
"My dear Julien,


00:29:48.585 --> 00:29:52.392
I can't stop thinking
about our relationship.


00:29:53.156 --> 00:29:55.760
Your humor and gallanty seduced me.


00:29:56.993 --> 00:30:00.332
Yesterday I went shopping
with the girls.


00:30:00.963 --> 00:30:02.800
I think I found your perfume.


00:30:06.936 --> 00:30:09.473
ls it by chance the


00:30:09.638 --> 00:30:11.675
Insurrection de Colin Arpel?"


00:30:18.714 --> 00:30:19.749
No, it's not.


00:30:20.281 --> 00:30:21.951
"That time, it was love at first sight.


00:30:22.884 --> 00:30:27.092
When you kissed me on the cheek
at the Henri-Bourrassa,


00:30:27.255 --> 00:30:28.824
and brushing against my cheek.


00:30:31.526 --> 00:30:32.961
I shut my eyes


00:30:33.128 --> 00:30:36.601
and I believed it was
Champs-Élysées.


00:30:36.764 --> 00:30:39.503
C H A N S


00:30:40.768 --> 00:30:44.241
É L I S É S."


00:30:45.472 --> 00:30:46.808
He calls me "Miss".


00:30:47.941 --> 00:30:49.209
I was.


00:30:50.310 --> 00:30:53.215
It looks like a match between
Musset and George Sand.


00:30:55.716 --> 00:30:58.220
It drags. I hate it.


00:30:59.420 --> 00:31:02.592
Now he's ruining
all my favorite places because...


00:31:03.322 --> 00:31:04.490
when he's not there,


00:31:04.824 --> 00:31:07.094
having a beer with friends...


00:31:07.627 --> 00:31:08.997
When he's not there,


00:31:09.929 --> 00:31:10.829
I'm bored.


00:31:11.764 --> 00:31:12.932
It's not fun.


00:31:13.566 --> 00:31:17.407
Yet, the weather's nice,
the birds are singing and the wine's good...


00:31:17.603 --> 00:31:19.105
I am quiet.


00:31:20.038 --> 00:31:21.173
It's not fun.


00:31:22.974 --> 00:31:24.544
But when he's there, watch out!


00:31:24.876 --> 00:31:27.948
As if I am on speed,
I say "Hi" to everyone.


00:31:29.281 --> 00:31:31.318
I act like I'm a country bumpkin.


00:31:31.583 --> 00:31:33.386
Saint-Donat.


00:31:35.087 --> 00:31:36.656
Worst thing is, I hardly talk to him.


00:31:38.022 --> 00:31:39.291
But I know that he sees me.


00:31:40.124 --> 00:31:42.294
We see people even without looking at them.


00:31:43.928 --> 00:31:45.263
