00:31:45.896 --> 00:31:46.897
And I'm looking there.


00:31:49.233 --> 00:31:50.201
I see you.


00:31:50.501 --> 00:31:52.438
I'm not looking at you,
but I see you.


00:31:53.270 --> 00:31:54.271
I know...


00:31:55.072 --> 00:31:56.874
where you're looking. I know...


00:31:57.808 --> 00:31:59.076
