01:31:05.618 --> 01:31:08.589
Ever met someone so depressed?


01:31:08.721 --> 01:31:11.292
My God! I've been a hairdresser for 20 years!


01:31:11.756 --> 01:31:13.826
I crimped empty spoons!


01:31:25.003 --> 01:31:27.742
Hello, Francis Riverekim...


01:31:29.507 --> 01:31:31.410
I went shopping at Bagatelles yesterday,


01:31:31.642 --> 01:31:35.481
and I bought mismatched cups
to serve tea.


01:31:35.779 --> 01:31:38.317
I don't know if you're free,


01:31:38.782 --> 01:31:41.387
but you're invited for
afternoon tea.


01:31:42.019 --> 01:31:43.589
Ok, call me back.


01:31:44.188 --> 01:31:47.294
Oh, I quitted smoking.
Call me back. Bye.


01:31:57.734 --> 01:31:58.836
I'm out of madeleines.


01:32:00.134 --> 01:32:01.436
Such a shame!


01:32:05.909 --> 01:32:07.077
It's beautiful, your beard.


01:32:07.844 --> 01:32:08.879
Thanks.


01:32:09.679 --> 01:32:11.749
You've joined the club of bears?


01:32:15.179 --> 01:32:16.449
No.


01:32:21.823 --> 01:32:23.560
Here's that armchair,
that I wanted to show you.


01:32:25.060 --> 01:32:26.463
The armchair that I mentioned.


01:32:28.196 --> 01:32:29.231
Yeah, right.


01:32:34.669 --> 01:32:36.072
Have you seen Nico lately?


01:32:37.206 --> 01:32:39.307
Er... Yes?


01:32:40.142 --> 01:32:41.511
I saw him in a bar.


01:32:42.476 --> 01:32:44.078
Did you go together?


01:32:45.279 --> 01:32:46.915
No, no... I was having a drink.


01:32:47.081 --> 01:32:49.653
He came in with his friends.
I just said hi.


01:32:56.023 --> 01:32:57.358
He's going to Asia.


01:32:58.925 --> 01:33:01.029
- Is he?
- Eight months.


01:33:02.996 --> 01:33:03.964
It's long.


01:33:12.538 --> 01:33:16.207
- Have you seen him?
- No.


01:33:23.048 --> 01:33:23.983
More tea?


01:33:24.783 --> 01:33:25.851
Sure, good idea.


01:34:46.861 --> 01:34:51.002
One year later...


01:35:48.454 --> 01:35:52.257
Who is this ugly Rockabilly
that looks like a ghoul in Krakow?


01:35:55.560 --> 01:35:56.662
Yuck!


01:36:19.116 --> 01:36:20.984
I'm really glad...


01:38:00.000 --> 01:38:10.000
Subtitles By ArchaicFurore

